---
import PortfolioLayout from '../../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
---
<PortfolioLayout title="联系 — 王誉翔" contact>
  <section class="letter-page content-shell"><header class="letter-heading"><p class="section-kicker">联系 / SAY HELLO</p><h1><span data-line-reveal>有个想法？</span><span data-line-reveal>写信给我。</span></h1><p>工作机会、项目交流，或者打个招呼。<br/>很高兴认识你。</p></header>
    <div class="letter-layout"><form class="letter-form" data-contact-form data-recipient={profile.email} action={'mailto:'+profile.email} method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <div class="letter-field"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><label for="sender-name">怎么称呼你？ <small>必填</small></label><input id="sender-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="你的名字" required maxlength="60"/></div></div>
      <div class="letter-field"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><label for="sender-email">我可以回复到哪个邮箱？ <small>必填</small></label><input id="sender-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required maxlength="160"/></div></div>
      <div class="letter-field"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><label for="sender-company">你所在的公司或团队</label><input id="sender-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="公司 / 团队名称（选填）" maxlength="100"/></div></div>
      <div class="letter-field"><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><div><label for="sender-subject">想聊些什么？</label><input id="sender-subject" name="subject" placeholder="工作机会、产品交流，或者其他" maxlength="120"/></div></div>
      <div class="letter-field"><span aria-hidden="true">05</span><div><label for="sender-message">写下你的留言 <small>必填</small></label><textarea id="sender-message" name="message" placeholder="你好，誉翔……" required maxlength="1500" rows="4"></textarea></div></div>
      <div class="letter-send"><p id="send-note">点击投递会打开邮件应用。<br/>内容由你确认后发送。</p><button type="submit" class="fill-button circle send-button" data-magnetic aria-describedby="send-note"><span>投递 ↗</span></button></div>
      <p class="letter-status" data-contact-status role="status"></p><div class="letter-fallback" data-contact-fallback hidden><button type="button" class="text-link" data-copy-letter>复制信件内容</button><p>没有打开邮件应用？复制后发送至 <a href={'mailto:'+profile.email}>{profile.email}</a>。</p><textarea aria-label="可复制的信件内容" data-letter-copy readonly hidden></textarea></div>
    </form><aside class="letter-details"><div class="letter-avatar"><img src="/images/yuxiang-portrait-railing-v4.webp" alt="王誉翔" width="1024" height="1536"/></div><span class="letter-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↙</span><h2>联系方式</h2><a href={'mailto:'+profile.email}>{profile.email}</a><a href={'tel:+86'+profile.phone}>{profile.phoneDisplay}</a><h2>也可以在这里找到我</h2><a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><p>小红书 / {profile.xiaohongshu}</p><h2>更多关于我</h2><a href="/about/">个人故事 ↗</a><a href="/resume/">完整简历 ↗</a></aside></div>
  </section>
  <script src="../../scripts/contact-form.ts"></script>
</PortfolioLayout>
